    "detailed_description": "Starblast: 3D Wars is a new take on the twin-stick genre by adding a refined dash mechanic, nice visuals, and an ungodly plethora of colors!<br><br><strong>This game has:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Familiar arcade gameplay with inspiration from a specific classic from the seventh generation, given new life with modernized controls and new mechanics!<br></li><li> Several ways to play: Lots of modes to choose from that have unique rulesets and gimmicks to spice up gameplay!<br></li><li> Several types of enemies, each with their own behavioral pattern that can be learned and strategized around!<br></li><li> Integrated Steam Leaderboards: compete with friends and strangers alike by aiming for the highest scores possible!<br></li><li> Much more!</li></ul>",
